# File storage - portfolio media uploaded by admin. Persisted as a Docker
# named volume in prod (Dokploy: Mount Type = Volume Mount, NOT Bind Mount).
storage/

# seed-files/ contains a one-time bootstrap set of media baked into the image.
# server.ts copies them to /app/storage/files/ on first boot if the named
# volume is empty. Once the volume is populated they can be removed from git
# (a follow-up commit) and future builds won't ship them.
# seed-files/  <- left tracked for now, remove the leading # once the prod
#                 volume is confirmed populated
